    "text": "The integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>13</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, is equal to&nbsp;",
